# 统一换行符：仓库内与工作区都用 LF，避免 Windows(CRLF) 与
# 云端/其他 Agent(LF) 之间来回转换产生「整文件 diff」噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# lock 文件在 diff / merge 时按二进制处理，减少冲突噪音
package-lock.json -diff -merge linguist-generated
